<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 100 mln stg Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 100 mln stg Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    16.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.045   PAY DATE   S-6.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.47     SPREAD	+50 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PERCENT 2002 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	NO 144A</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
